cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use bankstatementparser-mcp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "bankstatementparser-mcp: Model Context Protocol server for bank statement ingestion"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server exposing the bankstatementparser library to
  AI agents: five tools for discovering, detecting, parsing, validating and
  summarising bank statements in ISO 20022 CAMT.053 and pain.001, SWIFT
  MT940, OFX/QFX and CSV, from inline content.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.19"
date-released: "2026-08-31"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/bankstatementparser-mcp"
url: "https://bankstatementparser.com"
keywords:
  - bank statements
  - ISO 20022
  - CAMT.053
  - MT940
  - OFX
  - Model Context Protocol
  - MCP
  - AI agents
  - banking
